# Status enum
class Status(Enum):
    OPEN = "open"
    IN_PROGRESS = "in_progress"
    CLOSED = "closed"
    BLOCKED = "blocked"

# WorklogItem dataclass
@dataclass
class WorklogItem:
    id: str                          # UUID or auto-generated
    title: str                       # Required, non-empty
    researcher: str                  # Required, non-empty
    status: Status                   # Default: OPEN
    topic: str                       # Required, non-empty
    tags: list[str]                  # Default: []
    created: datetime                # Auto-set on creation
    updated: datetime                # Auto-set on creation, updated on mutation
    confidence: float                # 0.0-1.0, default 0.5
    notes: str                       # Default: ""
    
    # Methods:
    # - to_dict() -> dict
    # - from_dict(d: dict) -> WorklogItem
    # - is_stale(days: int) -> bool  # updated > days ago
```

**Validation Rules:**
- `id`: non-empty, unique
- `title`: 1-500 chars
- `researcher`: 1-100 chars
- `topic`: 1-200 chars
- `tags`: list of 1-50 char strings, max 10 tags
- `confidence`: 0.0 ≤ x ≤ 1.0
- `status`: one of Status enum values
- `created`, `updated`: ISO 8601 format in JSON

